{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nA read-only process page: a process tree with CPU / memory, the listening ports and which process owns them, and a per-process detail. Answers \"what is running\" and \"who holds this port\" without leaving vig.\n\n## Non-goals\n- Read-only, like every vig page: the view inspects, it never mutates (no start/stop/kill/apply/switch). No signals of any kind.\n- Environment variables are never read or displayed.\n\n## Sub-issues\n- #94 — Procs: page skeleton\n- #95 — Procs: processes pane\n- #96 — Procs: ports pane\n- #97 — Procs: detail pane\n\n(suggested order: skeleton → processes → ports → detail)\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:14:21Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":93,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Procs view"}
